WEBVTT

00:22:55.787 --> 00:23:00.250
But cancer activists don't like
to have issues mixed together,

00:23:00.291 --> 00:23:04.504
so I didn't want to do it if the cancer
community wouldn't stand with me.

00:23:04.546 --> 00:23:06.423
But it's good.

00:23:06.464 --> 00:23:09.717
Thank you for thinking of me,
and I'm just fine, thank you.

00:23:10.468 --> 00:23:14.597
PM: Well, it's just so great
to know that you are well

00:23:14.639 --> 00:23:16.224
and you are continuing this work.

00:23:16.266 --> 00:23:20.061
And as Jane reminds me,
and I'm just going to quote her on this,

00:23:20.103 --> 00:23:23.731
"Activism is the antidote to aging."

00:23:23.731 --> 00:23:27.444
And Jane Fonda is a perfect
example of that working,

00:23:27.485 --> 00:23:30.071
not just for her, but for the world.